## Pipeline Architecture

This project proposes a 3-tier system — drawing on the GUARDIAN framework (Lin, 2026) — adapted for deployment within Singapore's school and community mental health settings.
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    INPUT LAYER                                  │
│  Social media text (Mandarin/English) · Wearable signals        │
│  Smartphone metadata · Self-report survey responses             │
└─────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────┘
│
┌─────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    TIER 1: SCREENING                            │
│  Text Classification — Distress Signal Detection                │
│  Model: Chinese MentalBERT (Ji et al., 2024)                   │
│  Languages: Mandarin (Traditional/Simplified) + English         │
│  Output: Binary low/high distress flag                          │
└─────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────┘
│
┌─────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    TIER 2: RISK SCORING                         │
│  Contextual Risk Assessment                                     │
│  Features: Linguistic markers · Temporal patterns              │
│            Social isolation signals · Help-seeking behaviour    │
│  Model: XGBoost classifier                                      │
│  Output: Risk score (0–100) with interpretable feature weights  │
└─────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────┘
│
┌─────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    TIER 3: TEMPORAL FORECASTING                 │
│  7-Day Trajectory Prediction                                    │
│  Model: LSTM with memory-based context encoding                 │
│  Reference: Eckstein et al. (2026) — memory representations    │
│             at multiple timescales                              │
│  Output: Risk trajectory + recommended intervention timing      │
└─────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────┘
│
┌─────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    OUTPUT / ACTION LAYER                        │
│  Low risk    → HealthHub self-care resources                 │
│  Medium risk → CHAT webCHAT referral + peer support         │
│  High risk   → REACH school counsellor escalation           │
│                   + IMH crisis pathway activation               │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
