## Why Asian Adolescents Specifically?

| Dimension | Western Context | Asian Adolescent Context |
|---|---|---|
| **Language** | English | Mandarin, mixed code-switching |
| **Expression** | Direct emotional disclosure | Indirect, somatic, metaphorical |
| **Platform** | Reddit, Twitter | Instagram, Discord, LINE, Xiaohongshu |
| **Help-seeking** | Individual | Family-mediated, stigma-avoidant |
| **Distress signals** | "I feel depressed" | Academic pressure framing, physical complaints |

Generic NLP models trained on Western English data **systematically miss** these signals. Chinese MentalBERT (Ji et al., 2024) achieves F1=88.39% on Chinese suicide risk data — compared to much lower performance from general BERT models on the same task.

