## Ethical Considerations

1. **Clinical safety first** — NLP outputs support, never replace, clinical judgment
2. **Transparency** — All model decisions are interpretable and explainable
3. **Cultural validity** — Models must be validated on Asian adolescent populations
4. **Consent and privacy** — Real-world deployment requires explicit informed consent
5. **Equity** — Regular audits to prevent systematic disadvantage

